# No borders / strokes on controls

Do **not** add borders or outline strokes on interactive elements (text fields, textareas, buttons, chips, inputs, edit frames). Prefer fill, spacing, typography, and focus background only.

- Options NOTE / TASK and similar edits: fill + focus plate, no `Frame`/`TextEdit` stroke.
- Structural dividers / panel card edges are OK when the existing layout already uses them — not control chrome.
- See root `AGENTS.md` (“No borders / strokes on controls”).
